OL,3,GNEWSATraffic concerns over lithium
OL,4,Aplant proposal
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a lithium plant next to a
OL,7,Fnarrow road have left some residents
OL,8,Fworried about traffic.
OL,10,FNorthern Lithium is looking to create a
OL,11,Flithium plant on land at Ludwell Farm,
OL,12,FEastgate, near Stanhope in County
OL,13,FDurham.
OL,15,FBut some locals have raised concerns
OL,16,Fover increased traffic on the C74 road,
OL,17,Fwith one resident saying passing HGV
OL,18,Fvehicles on the route was "impossible".
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
