OL,3,GNEWSATraffic concerns over lithium
OL,4,Aplant proposal
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Lithium said the development
OL,7,Fwould have "minimal impact" on local
OL,8,Froads, with planning documents stating
OL,9,Fits contributions towards lithium
OL,10,Fproduction could be of "national
OL,11,Fimportance".
